{"parentUuid":"ea444ee0-3a12-4e60-9285-71e93e5c6dd5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch9noDmpbCTBbgYW1U9UV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've updated History so its graph looks the same as the Git panel. Before the change I screenshotted the Git panel, and afterwards I screenshotted GitDeck History to compare them. The two now look the same.\n\n| Item | Before | Now (same as the Git panel) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Branch label | Plain text, outline only | Branch icon (⑂) and the fixed-width terminal font |\n| Current branch | Outline only | ✓ icon, filled with the line color, bold |\n| Local and remote with the same name | Two labels, `main` and `origin/main` | One label, `main │ origin` |\n| Remote-only branch | Gray outline | Cloud icon, outlined in the line color |\n| Tag | Shown with a `◆` character | Tag icon, yellow |\n| Merge commit title | Same as other commits | Dimmed |\n| Line colors | 6 | 12, the same order as the Git panel |\n| Full ref name | Not shown | Shown in a tooltip when you hover a label |\n\n**What changed**\n- Grouping the labels (merging a local branch with its remote, putting the current branch first, shortening long names) is new logic. It lives in `src/core/graph/refLabels.ts`, and `tests/refLabels.test.ts` has 5 tests for it. I wrote the tests first and they failed, because the function didn't exist yet. After writing the function they pass.\n- The label drawing and the dimmed merge titles are in `src/ui/graph.ts`, and the 12 line colors are in `src/ui/style.ts`.\n- The ✓, cloud and tag icons are copied from the Git panel into `mod/icons/`. They're Lucide icons, and the Lucide license file is already in the project.\n\n**Checks**\n- `pnpm verify` passed: all 408 tests, 99.67% line coverage.\n- `herdr-app status` shows `\"errors\": []`.\n- Screenshot after the change: `/private/tmp/claude-501/-Volumes-WorkSpace-vogle-herdr-gitdeck/c36cb7dc-d64c-445a-9a8d-ccb9a1219a29/scratchpad/after-crop.png`\n- I only compared screenshots. I didn't hover a label to see the tooltip.\n\n**Not changed**\n- The Git panel's labels respond to double-click (checkout) and right-click (menu). I left that out because you only asked for icons and colors.\n- The Herdr panel is back on GitDeck and showing the History tab."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1947,"cache_read_input_tokens":295285,"output_tokens":1181,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":15},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1947,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1181,"cache_read_input_tokens":295285,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1947,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1947},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"98674e6a-4fbe-4912-b580-497923508267","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Ch9noDXgx4dUGygLGbpDv","requestRef":"ca535cf7-865e-430e-a380-66c67277ac0b","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"7cf62d7e-61fd-4942-b798-99b436473457","timestamp":"2026-11-18T04:49:49.206Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","madeBy":"model","session_id":"c36cb7dc-d64c-445a-9a8d-ccb9a1219a29","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Volumes/WorkSpace/vogle/herdr-gitdeck","sessionId":"c36cb7dc-d64c-445a-9a8d-ccb9a1219a29","version":"2.1.325","gitBranch":"feat/agent-centered-panel","slug":"nifty-leaping-sketch"}
