{"parentUuid":"e7ecd024-2e9f-4547-837b-b23417c434e8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch9oY2EEoxPQueNHiSX3W","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"History now looks like Fork, and the checks pass. Here's what changed.\n\n| Item | Now |\n|---|---|\n| Label icon | GitHub logo if the remote is on GitHub, GitLab logo if it's on GitLab, otherwise the generic git logo, each in its own box |\n| Telling GitLab apart | From the remote address. If your repo has a `gitdeck.forge` setting (for a company GitLab such as `bsp-git.uzen.io`), that decides it for origin |\n| Label shape | Filled with a light tint of the line color. Local and remote branches with the same name show as one label with the logo |\n| Tag | Tag icon, purple label |\n| Commit title | `feat:`, `chore(main):` and the like in bold |\n| Merge commit | Shown as a ring with a chevron, title dimmed |\n| Author | Colored circle with initials (`AI`, `D`, `G`) before the name. Each name always gets the same color, and nothing is requested from outside |\n\n**What changed**\n- Making the prefix bold took a few tries. `font_semibold()` and `font_bold()` looked the same as normal text on screen, so I set `font_weight(700)` directly.\n- New logic is in 3 files. There are 12 new tests (the 5 from earlier plus 7 more), and the 7 new ones failed first, then passed.\n  - `src/core/graph/remoteKind.ts`: works out each remote's type\n  - `src/core/graph/rowText.ts`: splits off the title prefix and makes the initials\n  - `src/core/history.ts`: loading History now also reads the remote types\n- The logos are from Simple Icons, which is CC0 (free to use). I recorded where they came from in `mod/icons/LICENSE-simple-icons.txt`.\n\n**Checks**\n- `pnpm verify` passed: all 415 tests, 99.67% line coverage.\n- `herdr-app status` shows `\"errors\": []`.\n- Zoomed screenshot: `/private/tmp/claude-501/-Volumes-WorkSpace-vogle-herdr-gitdeck/c36cb7dc-d64c-445a-9a8d-ccb9a1219a29/scratchpad/zoom.png`\n\n**Not checked on screen**\n- The current branch label at the top (✓ and solid fill). The list was scrolled down when I took the screenshot.\n- The GitLab logo. I only saw this repo, which is on GitHub, not a GitLab repo like BNKR-3710."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":750,"cache_read_input_tokens":352819,"output_tokens":1390,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":187},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":750,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1390,"cache_read_input_tokens":352819,"cache_creation_input_tokens":750,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":750},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"7c7733bc-3681-42f1-be06-4f1412bc5d10","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Ch9oY1stzVZxCGwZ9V8GR","requestRef":"8efb3ecf-9b80-4462-a4d1-774218451be8","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"eb765d84-ca7b-4517-a915-d3f813adffe7","timestamp":"2026-11-18T04:59:31.911Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","madeBy":"model","session_id":"c36cb7dc-d64c-445a-9a8d-ccb9a1219a29","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Volumes/WorkSpace/vogle/herdr-gitdeck","sessionId":"c36cb7dc-d64c-445a-9a8d-ccb9a1219a29","version":"2.1.325","gitBranch":"feat/agent-centered-panel","slug":"nifty-leaping-sketch"}
