{"attachment":{"command":"","content":"","durationMs":76,"exitCode":0,"hookEvent":"","hookName":"","stderr":"","stdout":"","toolUseID":"","type":"hook_success"},"cwd":"/Volumes/WorkSpace/vogle/herdr-gitdeck","entrypoint":"cli","gitBranch":"feat/agent-centered-panel","isSidechain":false,"parentUuid":"5f23266a-cb8b-412a-b668-a578f7a05093","sessionId":"c36cb7dc-d64c-445a-9a8d-ccb9a1219a29","session_id":"c36cb7dc-d64c-445a-9a8d-ccb9a1219a29","slug":"nifty-leaping-sketch","timestamp":"2026-11-18T05:04:33.465Z","type":"attachment","userType":"external","uuid":"486ba793-b2c2-42e1-8303-e4f964f8317b","version":"2.1.325"}
{"parentUuid":"ef79918d-c9c6-4723-aaa2-7ce9580ce367","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a839a4fb-7dd5-4c35-a523-15c45a35bd9a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BnxHYPVLkweXS3YrE612kH","type":"tool_result","content":"herdr-app: the Herdr desktop app. With no arguments it opens the window.\n\nUsage:\n  herdr-app                        open the window\n  herdr-app ls                     spaces, their tabs and terminals, in the open window\n  herdr-app do <command> [args]    run a command: --name api --argv '[\"pi\"]', or one JSON object\n  herdr-app feedback <text>        draft feedback for the person to review and send\n  herdr-app commands               every command, its arguments, what it does\n  herdr-app status                 what the window shows, and any errors\n  herdr-app shot [file.png]        save the current window frame (default: herdr-shot.png)\n  herdr-app check <mod folder>     load a mod once and report what's wrong\n  herdr-app --skill                Agent Skill: driving the window, and where hc fits\n  herdr-app --version\n\nThe terminals run in herdr-core (`hc`), which keeps them alive when the\nwindow closes. `hc --help`: start, read, wait on and talk to terminals and\nagents. The app shows them and arranges them in spaces and tabs.\n\nHome: ~/.config/herdr-app (HERDR_APP_HOME picks another).\n{\n  \"error\": \"unknown command \\\"--help\\\": see `herdr-app commands`; a mod's are <mod>.<command> and need the mod loaded\"\n}","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"eccc5eab-9eea-4f35-b025-b8919d02d46f","timestamp":"2026-11-18T05:04:33.530Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"herdr-app: the Herdr desktop app. With no arguments it opens the window.\n\nUsage:\n  herdr-app                        open the window\n  herdr-app ls                     spaces, their tabs and terminals, in the open window\n  herdr-app do <command> [args]    run a command: --name api --argv '[\"pi\"]', or one JSON object\n  herdr-app feedback <text>        draft feedback for the person to review and send\n  herdr-app commands               every command, its arguments, what it does\n  herdr-app status                 what the window shows, and any errors\n  herdr-app shot [file.png]        save the current window frame (default: herdr-shot.png)\n  herdr-app check <mod folder>     load a mod once and report what's wrong\n  herdr-app --skill                Agent Skill: driving the window, and where hc fits\n  herdr-app --version\n\nThe terminals run in herdr-core (`hc`), which keeps them alive when the\nwindow closes. `hc --help`: start, read, wait on and talk to terminals and\nagents. The app shows them and arranges them in spaces and tabs.\n\nHome: ~/.config/herdr-app (HERDR_APP_HOME picks another).\n{\n  \"error\": \"unknown command \\\"--help\\\": see `herdr-app commands`; a mod's are <mod>.<command> and need the mod loaded\"\n}","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ef79918d-c9c6-4723-aaa2-7ce9580ce367","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"hook","reasonType":"hook"},"session_id":"c36cb7dc-d64c-445a-9a8d-ccb9a1219a29","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Volumes/WorkSpace/vogle/herdr-gitdeck","sessionId":"c36cb7dc-d64c-445a-9a8d-ccb9a1219a29","version":"2.1.325","gitBranch":"feat/agent-centered-panel","slug":"nifty-leaping-sketch"}
