{"attachment":{"command":"","content":"","durationMs":77,"exitCode":0,"hookEvent":"","hookName":"","stderr":"","stdout":"","toolUseID":"","type":"hook_success"},"cwd":"/Volumes/WorkSpace/vogle/herdr-gitdeck","entrypoint":"cli","gitBranch":"feat/agent-centered-panel","isSidechain":false,"parentUuid":"53035c21-f1a9-4f2a-a749-2b04df57694f","sessionId":"c36cb7dc-d64c-445a-9a8d-ccb9a1219a29","session_id":"c36cb7dc-d64c-445a-9a8d-ccb9a1219a29","slug":"nifty-leaping-sketch","timestamp":"2026-11-19T00:44:05.234Z","type":"attachment","userType":"external","uuid":"53e24d1a-9d6e-4349-a5d1-fc048a1fb751","version":"2.1.325"}
{"parentUuid":"9e5cafac-43df-41ad-b1cc-89d2d10144a9","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"43eb4842-444d-4542-9f2c-31b194183d64","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016oGXDoZwym2d133hqh6oCc","type":"tool_result","content":"- `notify({ ..., action: { name, args } })`: the toast runs the command when clicked.\n- This copy: `props()`, `shared(key)` / `setShared(key, value)` (every mod\n  sees it; setting re-renders all), `nextCommand()` (key commands for this\n  mod: `cx.spawn(async (cx) => { for (;;) { const c = await nextCommand(); …; cx.notify(); } })`).\n\nMods are trusted code: commands and network access (including `fetch`) are unrestricted.\nOther built-ins: `localStorage` (per mod copy), `console.log`, `fetch`,\n`import * as fs from \"fs/promises\"` (read in home, write under `~/.config/herdr-app`).\n\n## herdr-core (`hc`)\n\n`herdr-app --skill` prints the manual for driving this window;\n\n## Herdr rules that bite\n\n- Herdr runs **`main.js` only** (QuickJS): TypeScript is bundled by esbuild\n  into one file. `herdr`, `gpui-kit`, `gpui-base` are provided at run time\n  (externals). No Node APIs, no `setTimeout`, no DOM.\n- **Never keep a `cx`.** Every callback and task gets its own.\n- **Never start work in `render()`.** It notices a change (`notice()`) and\n  fires the `Signal` that the git task started in `init` waits on.\n- `.when(cond, …)` needs a real boolean.\n- `exec`: an argument array (no shell), 30 s limit, 8 MiB output, **no stdin**.\n  Anything that needs input writes a file first (`writeTextFile`, under\n  `~/.config/herdr-app`). Long operations (clone, big push) belong in a\n  terminal (`hc`), not `exec`.\n- Every git call uses `--no-optional-locks`, so gitdeck never blocks an\n  agent's git in the same repo.\n- Each saved file reloads the mod, and herdr-app 0.1.x keeps old code alive per\n/Volumes/WorkSpace/vogle/herdr-gitdeck/src/changes.ts:6:import { exec, readTextFile, writeTextFile } from \"herdr\";\n/Volumes/WorkSpace/vogle/herdr-gitdeck/src/changes.ts:29:  write: (path, text, expected) => writeTextFile(path, text, expected),\n68:images, overlays, popups and floats. It captures the app, not the desktop,\n482:there are several), write its `RECIPE.md`, save a screenshot of it as\n670:  never one a package manager owns), `app.welcome`, `app.whats_new`, `app.feedback {message?, from?}` (from `\"person\"` or `\"agent\"`; opens a review window, where the person can paste up to 3 screenshots; never sends until the person clicks Send), `app.reset`,\n813:  Windows. Programs that capture the mouse still receive middle-clicks.\n814:  Hold Shift while dragging in programs that capture the mouse.\nShell cwd was reset to /Volumes/WorkSpace/vogle/herdr-gitdeck","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"153ce95b-767e-4696-8876-68eb8dc135ff","timestamp":"2026-11-19T00:44:05.328Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"- `notify({ ..., action: { name, args } })`: the toast runs the command when clicked.\n- This copy: `props()`, `shared(key)` / `setShared(key, value)` (every mod\n  sees it; setting re-renders all), `nextCommand()` (key commands for this\n  mod: `cx.spawn(async (cx) => { for (;;) { const c = await nextCommand(); …; cx.notify(); } })`).\n\nMods are trusted code: commands and network access (including `fetch`) are unrestricted.\nOther built-ins: `localStorage` (per mod copy), `console.log`, `fetch`,\n`import * as fs from \"fs/promises\"` (read in home, write under `~/.config/herdr-app`).\n\n## herdr-core (`hc`)\n\n`herdr-app --skill` prints the manual for driving this window;\n\n## Herdr rules that bite\n\n- Herdr runs **`main.js` only** (QuickJS): TypeScript is bundled by esbuild\n  into one file. `herdr`, `gpui-kit`, `gpui-base` are provided at run time\n  (externals). No Node APIs, no `setTimeout`, no DOM.\n- **Never keep a `cx`.** Every callback and task gets its own.\n- **Never start work in `render()`.** It notices a change (`notice()`) and\n  fires the `Signal` that the git task started in `init` waits on.\n- `.when(cond, …)` needs a real boolean.\n- `exec`: an argument array (no shell), 30 s limit, 8 MiB output, **no stdin**.\n  Anything that needs input writes a file first (`writeTextFile`, under\n  `~/.config/herdr-app`). Long operations (clone, big push) belong in a\n  terminal (`hc`), not `exec`.\n- Every git call uses `--no-optional-locks`, so gitdeck never blocks an\n  agent's git in the same repo.\n- Each saved file reloads the mod, and herdr-app 0.1.x keeps old code alive per\n/Volumes/WorkSpace/vogle/herdr-gitdeck/src/changes.ts:6:import { exec, readTextFile, writeTextFile } from \"herdr\";\n/Volumes/WorkSpace/vogle/herdr-gitdeck/src/changes.ts:29:  write: (path, text, expected) => writeTextFile(path, text, expected),\n68:images, overlays, popups and floats. It captures the app, not the desktop,\n482:there are several), write its `RECIPE.md`, save a screenshot of it as\n670:  never one a package manager owns), `app.welcome`, `app.whats_new`, `app.feedback {message?, from?}` (from `\"person\"` or `\"agent\"`; opens a review window, where the person can paste up to 3 screenshots; never sends until the person clicks Send), `app.reset`,\n813:  Windows. Programs that capture the mouse still receive middle-clicks.\n814:  Hold Shift while dragging in programs that capture the mouse.","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /Volumes/WorkSpace/vogle/herdr-gitdeck","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"9e5cafac-43df-41ad-b1cc-89d2d10144a9","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"hook","reasonType":"hook"},"session_id":"c36cb7dc-d64c-445a-9a8d-ccb9a1219a29","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Volumes/WorkSpace/vogle/herdr-gitdeck","sessionId":"c36cb7dc-d64c-445a-9a8d-ccb9a1219a29","version":"2.1.325","gitBranch":"feat/agent-centered-panel","slug":"nifty-leaping-sketch"}
