ty` style. A hidden panel keeps its place in the group, so its\n   *   siblings' sizes are undisturbed while it is away. Default `true`.\n   */\n  export function resizable_panel(): NativeElement;","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /Volumes/WorkSpace/vogle/herdr-gitdeck","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ccfba62e-a15a-4a93-a4b3-ca5a714f1ed9","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"hook","reasonType":"hook"},"session_id":"c36cb7dc-d64c-445a-9a8d-ccb9a1219a29","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Volumes/WorkSpace/vogle/herdr-gitdeck","sessionId":"c36cb7dc-d64c-445a-9a8d-ccb9a1219a29","version":"2.1.325","gitBranch":"feat/agent-centered-panel","slug":"nifty-leaping-sketch"}
