{"attachment":{"command":"","content":"","durationMs":91,"exitCode":0,"hookEvent":"","hookName":"","stderr":"","stdout":"","toolUseID":"","type":"hook_success"},"cwd":"/Volumes/WorkSpace/vogle/herdr-gitdeck","entrypoint":"cli","gitBranch":"feat/agent-centered-panel","isSidechain":false,"parentUuid":"e49b6211-3ea7-4a6e-9d86-918b0ae26733","sessionId":"c36cb7dc-d64c-445a-9a8d-ccb9a1219a29","session_id":"c36cb7dc-d64c-445a-9a8d-ccb9a1219a29","slug":"nifty-leaping-sketch","timestamp":"2026-11-19T04:23:51.943Z","type":"attachment","userType":"external","uuid":"d9622905-6935-442a-b920-f866acda8aab","version":"2.1.325"}
{"parentUuid":"2fbd7899-26ec-4746-9f6e-70a3bf8831d4","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"ab85b029-ae91-4807-b5dd-c38a9ffee13e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019xQBQC9vkKzZ5CjofYoQKN","type":"tool_result","content":"herdr-app: the Herdr desktop app. With no arguments it opens the window.\n\nUsage:\n  herdr-app                        open the window\n  herdr-app ls                     spaces, their tabs and terminals, in the open window\n  herdr-app do <command> [args]    run a command: --name api --argv '[\"pi\"]', or one JSON object\n  herdr-app feedback <text>        draft feedback for the person to review and send\n  herdr-app commands               every command, its arguments, what it does\n  herdr-app status                 what the window shows, and any errors\n  herdr-app shot [file.png]        save the current window frame (default: herdr-shot.png)\n  herdr-app check <mod folder>     load a mod once and report what's wrong\n  herdr-app --skill                Agent Skill: driving the window, and where hc fits\n  herdr-app --version\n\nThe terminals run in herdr-core (`hc`), which keeps them alive when the\nwindow closes. `hc --help`: start, read, wait on and talk to terminals and\nagents. The app shows them and arranges them in spaces and tabs.\n\nHome: ~/.config/herdr-app (HERDR_APP_HOME picks another).\n{\n  \"zoom\": 1.0,\n  \"font_size\": 14.0,\n  \"ui_font_size\": 13.0,\n  \"space\": \"sp0f04c38c30359f061af09412efe570bd\",\n  \"tab\": \"tb95a94153b63dac0bdad7e77a5773d609\",\n  \"focused_pane\": \"paff0cf9a740d490136f8c5a2944eaa0c\",\n  \"layout\": \"main-graph\",\n  \"agent\": \"t1m\",\n  \"floats\": {},\n  \"overlays\": [],\n  \"errors\": []\n}","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"218c5b86-7bf5-498b-801b-925143c6dfeb","timestamp":"2026-11-19T04:23:52.006Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"herdr-app: the Herdr desktop app. With no arguments it opens the window.\n\nUsage:\n  herdr-app                        open the window\n  herdr-app ls                     spaces, their tabs and terminals, in the open window\n  herdr-app do <command> [args]    run a command: --name api --argv '[\"pi\"]', or one JSON object\n  herdr-app feedback <text>        draft feedback for the person to review and send\n  herdr-app commands               every command, its arguments, what it does\n  herdr-app status                 what the window shows, and any errors\n  herdr-app shot [file.png]        save the current window frame (default: herdr-shot.png)\n  herdr-app check <mod folder>     load a mod once and report what's wrong\n  herdr-app --skill                Agent Skill: driving the window, and where hc fits\n  herdr-app --version\n\nThe terminals run in herdr-core (`hc`), which keeps them alive when the\nwindow closes. `hc --help`: start, read, wait on and talk to terminals and\nagents. The app shows them and arranges them in spaces and tabs.\n\nHome: ~/.config/herdr-app (HERDR_APP_HOME picks another).\n{\n  \"zoom\": 1.0,\n  \"font_size\": 14.0,\n  \"ui_font_size\": 13.0,\n  \"space\": \"sp0f04c38c30359f061af09412efe570bd\",\n  \"tab\": \"tb95a94153b63dac0bdad7e77a5773d609\",\n  \"focused_pane\": \"paff0cf9a740d490136f8c5a2944eaa0c\",\n  \"layout\": \"main-graph\",\n  \"agent\": \"t1m\",\n  \"floats\": {},\n  \"overlays\": [],\n  \"errors\": []\n}","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"2fbd7899-26ec-4746-9f6e-70a3bf8831d4","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"hook","reasonType":"hook"},"session_id":"c36cb7dc-d64c-445a-9a8d-ccb9a1219a29","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Volumes/WorkSpace/vogle/herdr-gitdeck","sessionId":"c36cb7dc-d64c-445a-9a8d-ccb9a1219a29","version":"2.1.325","gitBranch":"feat/agent-centered-panel","slug":"nifty-leaping-sketch"}
